an actual workflow. Wire these guards into a bounded successor acceptance/freeze path without modifying immutable #1635 files, and add integration fixtures that demonstrate malformed overrides fail before write and changed frozen documents cannot replace existing bytes.\n\nEverything else reviewed cleanly at this SHA: CI is green, unresolved current threads are zero, all #1635 tracked artifacts and runner are unchanged with exact hashes, targeted 7 precedes full 249 replay, reconstruction has zero mismatches and zero provider calls, and the repair script exposes no network/remote/canonical write path.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638#pullrequestreview-4738232586","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638","author_association":"OWNER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638#pullrequestreview-4738232586"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-20T19:25:20Z","commit_id":"befc4acad1a1fa710965b10f25ac8061929f8c27"},{"id":4738237551,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOO5D6p88AAAABGmvEbw","user":{"login":"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]","id":199175422,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOC98s_g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organization