hub.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Independent read-only re-review verdict: BLOCKED for exact head 0309946934295b6dba27324b15a45e7a26780201.\n\nThe two original integration blockers are now substantively wired, but two concrete defects remain in the new patch:\n\n1. The symlink-escape negative fixture is no longer executed. In test_crop_path_validation_fails_closed_at_external_root_boundary, only relative-root and missing-file cases remain. The outside/link/symlink assertions were accidentally moved into test_validate_cli_does_not_resolve_relative_crop_root_early after args.handler(args), inside a with self.assertRaisesRegex block. Since args.handler necessarily raises, those lines are unreachable; they also reference temporary and root that are undefined in that test. Move the symlink setup/assertion back under the TemporaryDirectory scope and ensure the test actually reaches it.\n\n2. freeze_prepared_bundle validates manifest.independent_truth.sha256 against the raw truth input file hash, but write_once_document serializes the truth as canonical JSON. A valid but non-canonical input file can therefore produce an output truth with a different hash while the output manifest still binds the old input hash. Either require every prepared input to already equal canonical_bytes(document), or validate/bind against the canonical output bytes. Add a non-canonical-input fixture that fails closed or proves the written manifest binds the written truth bytes.\n\nThe raw relative crop-root CLI bypass and the previously dead accept-review/freeze helpers are fixed in this head. Re-run the focused suite and targeted-7 then full-249 saved-response replay after addressing these two findings.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638#pullrequestreview-4738285594","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638","author_association":"OWNER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638#pullrequestreview-4738285594"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-20T19:31:43Z","commit_id":"0309946934295b6dba27324b15a45e7a26780201"},{"id":4738410582,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOO5D6p88AAAABGm5oVg","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638#pullrequestreview-4738410582","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen8